Here's a complete Checkout screen for a Telegram Mini App — cart summary, delivery address form with validation, and a Pay button wired to the Telegram `MainButton`/haptics when available (degrades gracefully to a plain in-page button outside Telegram).

**`src/types.ts`**
```ts
export interface CartItem {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  price: number; // in smallest currency unit's major form, e.g. 19.99
  quantity: number;
  imageUrl?: string;
}

export interface DeliveryAddress {
  fullName: string;
  phone: string;
  city: string;
  street: string;
  apartment: string;
  comment: string;
}

export const emptyAddress: DeliveryAddress = {
  fullName: '',
  phone: '',
  city: '',
  street: '',
  apartment: '',
  comment: '',
};
```

